The device function `Comparator` and the two CUDA kernels
`bitonicSortShared` and `oddEvenMergeSortShared` in main.cu are
reproduced, unmodified, from:

    NVIDIA/cuda-samples
    Directory: cpp/2_Concepts_and_Techniques/sortingNetworks/
    https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuda-samples/blob/master/cpp/2_Concepts_and_Techniques/sortingNetworks/
    Copyright (c) 2022, NVIDIA CORPORATION. All rights reserved.
    SPDX-License-Identifier: (BSD-3-Clause)

    Specifically:
      - `bitonicSortShared`      from sortingNetworks/bitonicSort.cu
      - `oddEvenMergeSortShared` from sortingNetworks/oddEvenMergeSort.cu
      - `Comparator`             from sortingNetworks/sortingNetworks_common.cuh

The `typedef unsigned int uint;` and `#define SHARED_SIZE_LIMIT 1024U`
definitions in main.cu are adapted (values only, not code) from the
same project's cpp/2_Concepts_and_Techniques/sortingNetworks/
sortingNetworks_common.h and sortingNetworks_common.cuh, under the
same copyright and license above.

